    "description": "What: ac-sam-dodge on a ROUTE \u2014 an F-16 ('Viper', no air-combat order) follows a 3-waypoint route ('Viper route', 120 m over the ground, 130 m/s) east across the range past a radar SAM ('Radar SAM') and a Stinger team ('Stinger Gunner'), both on their default SOPs (CE-10006, AC-9 / R-10030: a ROUTE transit's missile defence through the one MissileDefence; the route resumes at the waypoint not yet passed). Judge: the SAMs fire; the F-16 BEAMS with decoys; a SAM missile is DEFEATED; it is alive; after the defence it never flies back to the route's first waypoint and it reaches the last one."
